  "description": "Adds Shen and reworks official champions 002-008 as Lucian, Orianna, Briar, Sivir, Kled, Xayah, and Urgot. Version 0.10.0 upgrades Shen, Lucian, Orianna, Briar, and Sivir with clearer battle actors plus source-direct encyclopedia, side-list, scoreboard, and Ban/Pick portraits. Official 008 Demon is replaced by a six-legged ImageGen Urgot with W/E/R only: mobile Purge fire, Disdain shield/dash/flip, and Fear Beyond Death with a real 25% current-Health execute check whose splash fear occurs only after a confirmed kill. Urgot includes dedicated VFX, icons, Ban/Pick art and pinned official base-skin audio while retaining Xayah/Kled fixes, deterministic elemental drakes, and the existing Rift quality pack. Built for Teamfight Manager 2 v0.5.0 Mod API 0.8.",
